svg>Comments</a></li><li class=\"devlog_link\"><a class=\"action_btn\" href=\"https://somnatide-studio.itch.io/the-call-button/devlog\"><svg version=\"1.1\" stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" class=\"svgicon icon_news\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" width=\"18\" aria-hidden><rect x=\"1\" y=\"3\" width=\"22\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg>Devlog</a></li><li><a href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/4691471/the-call-button\" target=\"_blank\" data-label=\"related_btn\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\"><svg version=\"1.1\" stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" width=\"18\" aria-hidden><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_very_large family_poppins\"><div id=\"header\" class=\"header align_center has_image\"><img alt=\"The Call Button (OUT NOW!)\" src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwNjAzMDQ2LnBuZw==/original/26%2F0Gt.png\"/><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">The Call Button (OUT NOW!)</h1></div><div itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Product\" itemscope id=\"view_game_2621738\" class=\"view_game_page page_widget base_widget buy_on_top\"><div class=\"header_buy_row\"><p>A downloadable game for Windows</p><div class=\"buy_row\"><div class=\"button_message\"><a class=\"button buy_btn\" href=\"https://somnatide-studio.itch.io/the-call-button/purchase\">Buy Now</a><span class=\"buy_message\"><span itemprop=\"price\" class=\"dollars\">$5.39 USD</span> <span class=\"sub\">or more</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><h1><strong><em>The Call Button | OUT NOW!</em></strong></h1>\r\n<p><strong>A short, observation-based psychological thriller </strong>told across <strong>3 distinct acts</strong>. You are trapped in a constantly changing hospital room. Your only way out: <strong>memorize </strong>your surroundings, <strong>spot </strong>over <strong>60 terrifying anomalies</strong>, and survive<strong> 25 days. </strong>But the longer you stay, the worse your <strong>nightmares </strong>get. <em>Why did you steal the intel? What was it?</em></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwMTQyNjY5LmdpZg==/original/oEFgKe.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p>\r\n</p>\r\n<h2><em>Gameplay</em></h2>\r\n<p>Every day, you wake up in the exact same room. Memorize the original room and see if there have been any alarming changes today. There are no fights, and nowhere for you to hide...\r\n</p>\r\n<p><em>You have <strong>two</strong> <strong>choices</strong>:</em>\r\n</p>\r\n<ul><li><em><strong>Take</strong> your <strong>medication</strong> if you spot an anomaly.</em>\r\n</li><li><em><strong>Hit</strong> the <strong>call button</strong> for your daily check-in if you&#x27;re sure the room is safe</em></li></ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwMTQyNzMxLmdpZg==/original/AwadGL.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwMTQyNzI5LmdpZg==/original/Y1eHDA.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<h2><em>Face Your Interrogation</em></h2>\r\n<p>Every few days, you get nightmares. Sit across the table from your former HR director in surreal, <strong>interactive nightmare sequences.</strong> Relive your career, your mistakes, and the corporate espionage that put you in this hospital bed.\r\n</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwMTQyNjc5LmdpZg==/original/MpMRvl.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p><em>Key Features</em></p>\r\n<ul><li><em><strong>Playable Prologue:</strong> Experience the incident. Start a seemingly normal shift at the office and steal the secret information that seals your fate.</em>\r\n</li><li><strong><em>A 3-Act Narrative:</em></strong> Survive 25 days of escalating terror as you uncover the mystery across 3 acts and over 60 unpredictable anomalies.<br>\r\n</li><li><em><strong>Story Nightmares:</strong> Relive past events and past mistakes in <strong>interactive</strong> <strong>nightmare</strong> <strong>sequences</strong>, guided by a cold HR executive. Why are these memories appearing?</em>\r\n</li><li><em><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> The game features <strong>2 endings</strong> based on your choices.</em>\r\n</li><li><strong><em>Endless Mode:</em></strong> Not in the mood for the story? Do you just want to enjoy the pure thrill of hunting anomalies? Then simply select the Endless Mode in the menu!</li></ul></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg role=\"img\" height=\"6\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" width=\"12\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div id=\"game_info_panel_7086518\" class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Updated</td><td><abbr