<div dir=\"auto\" class=\"post_body user_formatted\"><p>For being only a short little demo, this was not too shabby so far! Solid anomaly horror game with a story and endless mode. I only ever played the story mode twice to get all the endings due to time, but for what I played I quite enjoyed this. Stellar graphics, great room design, great anomalies that I spotted. Only issue I had at some points was performance. Made a video on it.&nbsp;</p><div><button itchio aria-label=\"Click to activate YouTube embed\" type=\"button\" class=\"embed_preload youtube_preload\" data-embed_code=\"&lt;iframe width=&quot;500&quot; height=&quot;281&quot; src=&quot;//www.youtube.com/embed/Ci0m955ugyY&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 140px; background: url(https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Ci0m955ugyY/hqdefault.jpg) 50% 50% no-repeat; background-size: cover\"></button></div></div><div class=\"post_footer\"><a data-register_action=\"community_reply\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fsomnatide-studio.itch.io%2Fthe-call-button\" class=\"post_action reply_btn\">Reply</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"community_post_replies top_level_replies\"><div data-post=\"{&quot;id&quot;:16535084,&quot;user_id&quot;:16878679}\" id=\"post-16535084\" class=\"community_post has_vote_column is_reply\"><div class=\"post_grid\"><div class=\"post_votes\"><a data-register_action=\"community_vote\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fsomnatide-studio.itch.io%2Fthe-call-button\" title=\"Vote up\" class=\"vote_up_btn vote_btn\"><svg role=\"img\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" width=\"20\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_up\"><polygon points=\"2 18 12 6 22 18\" /></svg></a> <a data-register_action=\"community_vote\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fsomnatide-studio.itch.io%2Fthe-call-button\" title=\"Vote down\" class=\"vote_down_btn vote_btn\"><svg role=\"img\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" width=\"20\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_down\"><polygon points=\"2 6 12 18 22 6\" /></svg></a></div><a class=\"avatar_container\" href=\"https://itch.io/profile/somnatide-studio\"><div style=\"background-image: url(https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI2MzU5MTU3LnBuZw==/25x25%23/HVA3dq.png)\" class=\"post_avatar\"></div></a><div class=\"post_header\"><span class=\"post_author\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/profile/somnatide-studio\">Somnatide Studio</a></span><span title=\"2026-07-09 10:14:03\" class=\"post_date\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/post/16535084\">89 days ago</a></span> <span class=\"edit_message\">(2 edits)</span> <span class=\"vote_counts\"><span class=\"upvotes\">(+1)</span></span></div><div class=\"post_content\"><div dir=\"auto\" class=\"post_body user_formatted\"><p>Thanks for the feedback. I will look into the performance some more for the final release! (The games is very optimized; but I still noticed that the planar reflection from the mirror causes some spikes, so it’s probably that)</p></div><div class=\"post_footer\"><a data-register_action=\"community_reply\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fsomnatide-studio.itch.io%2Fthe-call-button\" class=\"post_action reply_btn\">Reply</a></div></div></div></div></div><div data-post=\"{&quot;id&quot;:16501555,&quot;user_id&quot;:4623508}\" id=\"post-16501555\" class=\"community_post has_vote_column\"><div class=\"post_grid\"><div class=\"post_votes\"><a data-register_action=\"community_vote\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=community&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fsomnatide-studio.itch.io%2Fthe-call-button\" title=\"Vote up\" class=\"vote_up_btn vote_btn\"><svg role=\"img\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" width=\"20\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_up\"><polygon points=\"2 18 12 6 22 18\" /></svg></a> <a data-register_actio